---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: cancel()
    q_check_auth --> q_check_tokens: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_tokens --> q_check_capital: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_tokens --> q_revert_tokens: tokens already supplied
    q_check_capital --> q_set_canceled: capitalWithdrawn == false OR capital returned to contract
    q_check_capital --> q_revert_capital: capital withdrawn without return
    q_set_canceled --> q_emit: isCanceled = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleCancelled
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_tokens --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_revert_capital --> [*]: revert CapitalWithdrawnWithoutReturn

    note right of q_check_capital
        INV-001: if capital withdrawn, project must return full amount + fees before cancel
        INV-002: cancel only before token supply
        INV-003: MiCA compliance requires refund capability
    end note
